# Mind Palette API - Integration Tests
# Recommended Extensions: "REST Client" (Humao.rest-client) or "HTTP Client" (JetBrains)

@apiGatewayUrl = http://localhost:8000
@preprocessServerUrl = http://localhost:8001
@aiServerUrl = http://localhost:8002
@requestId = test-client-{{$guid}}

### 1. API Gateway Health Check
GET {{apiGatewayUrl}}/health
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}

### 2. Preprocess Server Health Check
GET {{preprocessServerUrl}}/health
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}

### 3. AI Server Health Check
GET {{aiServerUrl}}/health
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}

### 4. End-to-End Analysis (Multipart Upload)
# Note: You need a sample image file at the specified path
POST {{apiGatewayUrl}}/analyze
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./api-gateway/test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 5. AI Server Direct Analysis (Simulation)
POST {{aiServerUrl}}/analyze
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="processed_sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./api-gateway/test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
